# Odoo 19 XML

```xml
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<field name="view_mode">tree,form</field>
<field name="arch" type="xml">
    <tree><field name="name"/></tree>
    <form>
        <field name="name" attrs="{'invisible': [('x','=',True)]}"/>
    </form>
</field>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<record id="view_sale_order_form_warranty" model="ir.ui.view">
    <field name="name">sale.order.form.warranty</field>
    <field name="model">sale.order</field>
    <field name="inherit_id" ref="sale.view_order_form"/>
    <field name="arch" type="xml">
        <xpath expr="//field[@name='date_order']" position="after">
            <field name="warranty_days" invisible="not partner_id"/>
        </xpath>
    </field>
</record>
```

- `list` not `tree`. Use `invisible` / `readonly` / `required` expressions, not `attrs`.
- Inherit with `inherit_id` + `xpath`. Resolve xml ids via Grep in the native module, not by guessing.
